      "text": "Step 6: Apply the Law of Sines in triangle \\( BDM \\):\n\\[ \\frac{BD}{\\sin \\angle DMB} = \\frac{DM}{\\sin \\angle DBM} \\]\nSince \\( \\angle DMB = 180^\\circ - 3\\theta \\) and \\( \\angle DBM = \\frac{180^\\circ - 3\\theta}{2} \\), we get:\n\\[ \\frac{BD}{\\sin (180^\\circ - 3\\theta)} = \\frac{1}{\\sin \\left(\\frac{180^\\circ - 3\\theta}{2}\\right)} \\]\n\\[ BD = \\frac{1}{\\sin \\left(\\frac{3\\theta}{2}\\right)} \\]",
